	(text "GVLB258.A patch test board: the Tinker-Beetle V2 antenna (AE1) on a board as wide as the Beetle\n(26.83 mm), with a vertical SMA jack on the back for the PX100 carrier (gnss-px100-18mm-hv) J1.\nPassive: no amplifier, no matching parts. The carrier already has the Beetle feed network\n(C81, D6, C20, C82), so with JP1 open the chain matches the Beetle from the patch pin on.\nRF_FEED is a 50 ohm grounded coplanar line on the back, straight from the feed pin to J1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 134.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "470c82d6-5a83-5ec6-a1df-e269b6dbbe5e")
	)
